Description: UPnP/DLNA media renderer for HiFiBerryOS
 Integrates gmediarender (gmrender-resurrect) as a UPnP/DLNA media
 renderer into HiFiBerryOS. Allows any UPnP/DLNA controller to stream
 audio to the HiFiBerry device.
 .
 This package provides the startup scripts, systemd service, metadata
 bridge for AudioControl integration, and Web UI registration files.
 The actual renderer binary is provided by the gmediarender package.
